OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fdry with clear spells through the
OL,7,Fevening and overnight. These clear
OL,8,Fspells and light winds will allow a
OL,9,Fwidespread frost to develop. Minimum
OL,10,FTemperature -3C.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FDry first thing but soon
OL,13,Fclouding over with some showery rain.
OL,14,FOften dry and bright in the afternoon,
OL,15,Fbut still the odd shower. Still quite
OL,16,Fchilly. Freshening northwest winds.
OL,17,FMaximum Temperature 7C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
