OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,6,Fcold few days with a scattering of
OL,7,Fshowers, becoming increasingly wintry.
OL,8,FChance of more persistent rain, sleet
OL,9,For snow on Tuesday. Chilly northerly
OL,10,Fwinds, strong at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
